    <causes>
      <Value Culture="ar-SA"><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u062A\u0633\u0628\u0628\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u064A\u0631\u0648\u0633\u0627\u062A \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0646\u0641\u0644\u0648\u0646\u0632\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u064A \u062A\u062A\u063A\u064A\u0631 \u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0648\u0633\u0645 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0622\u062E\u0631\u060C \u0648\u0644\u0647\u0630\u0627 \u064A\u064F\u062D\u062F\u064E\u0651\u062B \u0627\u0644\u0644\u0642\u0627\u062D \u0643\u0644 \u0639\u0627\u0645.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EIt is caused by influenza viruses, which change from season to season. This is why the vaccine is updated every year.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </causes>
    <diagnosis>
      <Value Culture="ar-SA"><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u064A\u064F\u0634\u062E\u064E\u0651\u0635 \u063A\u0627\u0644\u0628\u064B\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0639\u0631\u0627\u0636. \u0648\u0642\u062F \u064A\u064F\u0624\u062E\u0630 \u0645\u0633\u062D \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0646\u0641 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u062D\u0644\u0642 \u0641\u064A \u0628\u0639\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u062D\u0627\u0644\u0627\u062A\u060C \u062E\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0641\u064A \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0633\u062A\u0634\u0641\u0649.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EIt is usually diagnosed from the symptoms. A nose or throat swab is sometimes taken, especially in hospital.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </diagnosis>
    <emergencyWhen>
      <Value Culture="ar-SA"><![CDATA[صعوبة شديدة مفاجئة في التنفس أو ألم في الصدر
ازرقاق الشفاه أو الوجه
تشنجات، أو نعاس شديد وصعوبة في الاستيقاظ
رضيع أو طفل خامل لا يرضع، أو لديه طفح جلدي لا يختفي عند الضغط عليه]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Sudden severe difficulty breathing or chest pain
Blue lips or face
A seizure, or being very drowsy and hard to wake
A baby or child who is floppy, not feeding, or has a rash that doesn't fade when pressed]]></Value>
    </emergencyWhen>
